### Listar carros (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/carro

### Buscar carro por ID (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/carro/1

### Criar carro (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/carro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Fusca",
  "ano": 1990,
  "preco": 15000.00
}

### Atualizar carro (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/carro/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Gol",
  "ano": 2000,
  "preco": 25000.00
}

### Deletar carro (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/carro/1

### Listar usuários (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/usuario

### Buscar usuário por ID (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/usuario/1

### Criar usuário (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/usuario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria",
  "cargo": "Gerente",
  "salario": 3500.00
}

### Atualizar usuário (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/usuario/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Joana",
  "cargo": "Diretora",
  "salario": 5000.00
}

### Deletar usuário (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/usuario/1
